## 🔗 Module Interaction Flow

### 1. Token (PNJC) → Staking
User stakes PNJC
│
▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Staking Contract │
│ ├── transferFrom(user) → locks PNJC tokens │
│ ├── calculates rewards based on APY and lock duration │
│ └── rewards distributed in PNJC (mint or from reward pool) │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
│
▼
User receives stPNJC (receipt token) + earns yield

text

**Key functions:**
- `stake(amount, duration)` — locks tokens, mints stPNJC
- `unstake()` — burns stPNJC, returns principal + rewards
- `claimRewards()` — claims pending rewards without unstaking

---

### 2. Staking → Treasury (Reward Funding)
Treasury Contract
│
├── receives 15% of all transaction taxes (if tax enabled)
├── receives part of presale / liquidity funds
│
▼
Allocates funds to:
├── Staking Reward Pool (60% of treasury inflow)
├── Marketing Wallet (20%)
├── Charity / Donations (15%)
├── Team / Operations (5%)

text

**Constraint:** Treasury is a **multisig wallet** (3-of-5) to prevent misuse.

---

### 3. Token → Treasury (Auto-Flow via Tax)

*If transaction tax is enabled in PanjoCoin:*
PNJC Transfer (User A → User B)
│
▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Token Contract (before transfer) │
│ ├── calculate tax (e.g., 2%) │
│ ├── send tax amount to Treasury │
│ └── send remaining to recipient │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

text

This creates a **sustainable funding loop** without manual intervention.

---

### 4. Governance (DAO) → All Modules
Any PNJC holder can:
│
▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Governance Contract (OpenZeppelin Governor) │
│ ├── create proposal (e.g., "Change staking APY") │
│ ├── voting period (3 days) │
│ ├── quorum = 4% of total supply │
│ └── if passed → execute on-chain via timelock │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
│
├── can modify Staking parameters (APY, lock periods)
├── can modify Treasury allocation percentages
├── can update Token tax rate (within limits)
└── can upgrade contracts (via proxy, if used)

text

**Security:** All governance actions go through a **TimelockController** (minimum 24 hours delay).

