## 🧩 Module Responsibility Matrix

| Module          | Responsibility                                                                 | Owned by              |
|-----------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-----------------------|
| **Token (PNJC)**| ERC-20, mint/burn, optional tax, transfer logic, approvals                     | Deployer → later DAO  |
| **Staking**     | Lock tokens, distribute rewards, manage APY, unstake cooldown                   | DAO after launch      |
| **Treasury**    | Hold funds, distribute to reward pools, charity, marketing                     | Multisig (3/5) → DAO  |
| **Governance**  | Proposal creation, voting, quorum, timelock execution                          | PNJC holders          |

---

## 🔐 Security & Access Control

| Role              | Access Level                                      | Who has it?                    |
|-------------------|---------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------|
| **Default Admin** | Can upgrade contracts (if proxy), pause emergency | Initial deployer (to be renounced) |
| **Multisig**      | Can move treasury funds, approve large expenses   | 5 community members            |
| **DAO**           | Can change staking/token/tax parameters           | Any PNJC holder (vote-based)   |
| **Users**         | Transfer, stake, claim rewards, vote              | Everyone                       |

**Planned renouncement:** After DAO launch, admin keys will be burned or transferred to timelock.

