## 📦 Data Flow Example: User Staking PNJC

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant dApp
    participant StakingContract
    participant TokenContract
    participant TreasuryContract

    User->>dApp: Approve PNJC spend
    dApp->>TokenContract: approve(stakingAddress, amount)
    User->>dApp: Click "Stake"
    dApp->>StakingContract: stake(amount, 90 days)
    StakingContract->>TokenContract: transferFrom(user, staking, amount)
    TokenContract-->>StakingContract: tokens received
    StakingContract->>StakingContract: mint stPNJC to user
    StakingContract-->>dApp: success
    dApp-->>User: staked + receipt token shown
