✅ Summary of Module Dependencies
text
Token
  ↑ depends on: OpenZeppelin ERC20
  ↓ used by: Staking, Treasury (if tax enabled), Governance (voting power)

Staking
  ↑ depends on: Token (PNJC), Treasury (reward funding)
  ↓ used by: Governance (APY changes)

Treasury
  ↑ depends on: Token (tax), Multisig wallet
  ↓ funds: Staking rewards, Marketing, Charity

Governance
  ↑ depends on: Token (voting weight)
  ↓ controls: Staking, Treasury allocation, Token parameters (after timelock)
